set_title(f\"{ticker} ({vol_model}): ACF of Squared Std. Residuals\")\n","    axes[2].set_xlabel(\"Lag [days]\")\n","    axes[2].set_ylabel(\"Correlation Coefficient\")\n","\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","\n","for ticker in all_tickers:\n","    best_vol_model = best_model_lookup[ticker]\n","    plot_diagnostics(fitted_models[ticker][best_vol_model].model, ticker, best_vol_model)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"f04f018d","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.043879,"end_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.829079+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.7852+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["All 18 models are now compared on AIC/BIC, persistence, and asymmetry, with a best specification\n","identified per asset and its residuals checked for remaining structure. This stage produces the core\n","evidence for Research Questions 1 and 2. Next: out-of-sample walk-forward validation to see whether the\n","in-sample \"best\" model also forecasts best (Research Question 3, Stage 6)."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"ccfcc407","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.041861,"end_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.917428+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.875567+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## Stage 6: Walk-Forward Validation\n","\n","**Goal:** evaluate all three specifications out-of-sample using walk-forward forecasting, then check\n","whether the model that looked best in-sample (Stage 5, by AIC) is also the model that forecasts best\n","out-of-sample — this is the direct evidence for Research Question 3."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":42,"id":"75b53aa4","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.991846Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.991342Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.997235Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.996108Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.047905,"end_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.999739+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:53.951834+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["# A Note on Runtime\n","\n","# Walk-forward validation refits the model at every step of the test period. Run in full (6 assets × 3\n","# specifications × the full test window), this is genuinely slow — potentially tens of minutes on Kaggle.\n","# `MAX_TEST_DAYS` below caps the test window for faster iteration while you're debugging. Set it to `None`\n","# to use the full test set for your final submitted run.\n","\n","MAX_TEST_DAYS = None"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"407f2051","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.060246,"end_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.106381+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.046135+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["### Walk-Forward Forecast Function\n","\n","At each step, the model is refit using only data available up to that point, then produces a one-day-\n","ahead volatility forecast. This mirrors how the model would actually be used in production — never\n","peeking at future data."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":43,"id":"b5a3f289","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.212798Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.212341Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.222285Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.220986Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.061205,"end_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.224491+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.163286+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["def walk_forward_forecast(ticker, vol_model, p=1, q=1, max_test_days=None):\n","    \"\"\"Perform walk-forward, one-day-ahead volatility forecasting.\n","\n","    Parameters\n","    ----------\n","    ticker : str\n","    vol_model : str\n","        One of \"GARCH\", \"EGARCH\", \"GJR-GARCH\".\n","    p, q : int, optional\n","    max_test_days : int, None, optional\n","        If set, only forecasts the most recent `max_test_days` of the\n","        test period (for faster iteration). By default None (full test set).\n","\n","    Returns\n","    -------\n","    pd.Series\n","        Predicted one-day-ahead volatility (not variance), indexed by date.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    full_returns = returns_data[ticker]\n","    test_index = test_returns[ticker].index\n","    if max_test_days:\n","        test_index = test_index[-max_test_days:]\n","    test_size = len(test_index)\n","\n","    predictions = []\n","    for i in range(test_size):\n","        window = full_returns.loc[:test_index[i]].iloc[:-1]\n","\n","        if vol_model == \"GARCH\":\n","            spec = arch_model(window, p=p, q=q, vol=\"GARCH\", rescale=False)\n","        elif vol_model == \"EGARCH\":\n","            spec = arch_model(window, p=p, o=1, q=q, vol=\"EGARCH\", rescale=False)\n","        elif vol_model == \"GJR-GARCH\":\n","            spec = arch_model(window, p=p, o=1, q=q, vol=\"GARCH\", rescale=False)\n","\n","        fitted = spec.fit(disp=0)\n","        next_pred = fitted.forecast(horizon=1, reindex=False).variance.iloc[0, 0] ** 0.5\n","        predictions.append(next_pred)\n","\n","    return pd.Series(predictions, index=test_index, name=\"predicted_volatility\")"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":44,"id":"21d342d0","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.299583Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.298792Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-02T15:06:05.432018Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-02T15:06:05.430731Z"},"papermill":{"duration":191.171321,"end_time":"2026-10-02T15:06:05.434257+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-02T15:02:54.262936+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["AAPL - GARCH: 251 forecasts\n","AAPL - EGARCH: 251 forecasts\n","AAPL - GJR-GARCH: 251 forecasts\n","JPM - GARCH: 251 forecasts\n","JPM - EGARCH: 251 forecasts\n","JPM - GJR-GARCH: 251 forecasts\n","XOM - GARCH: 251 forecasts\n","XOM - EGARCH: 251